on a non-floating ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Variant"},{"text":" results in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"additional normal reference being added.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In other words, if the "},{"code":"value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is floating, then this call “assumes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ownership” of the floating reference, converting it to a normal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"reference.  If the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value"},{"type":"text","text":" is not floating, then this call adds a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"new normal reference increasing the reference count by one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All calls that result in a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Variant","isActive":true},{"text":" instance being inserted into a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"container will call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_variant_ref_sink()"},{"type":"text","text":" on the instance.  This means"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"that if the value was just created (and has only its floating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"reference) then the container will assume sole ownership of the value"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at that point and the caller will not need to unreference it.  This","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"makes certain common styles of programming much easier while still"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"maintaining normal refcounting semantics in situations where values","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not floating."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstrac